# Context Policies

Spec: ContextPolicies
Purpose:
  Govern freshness, authority, security, and pollution rules.

Freshness:
  FRESH:     updated < 7 days
  STALE:     updated >= 7 days and < 90 days
  CORRUPT:   updated >= 90 days or source unavailable

  STALE references MUST be flagged but not excluded.

Authority:
  Contract reference (OpenAPI) > Architecture reference (SDD)
  Runtime observation > Declared architecture
  Migration > SDD for database schema
  Human approval > AI inference

Security:
  Context MUST NOT contain:
    secrets, credentials, PII, production data, raw tokens

  Filter applies after compilation, before delivery.

Pollution Guard:
  Context MUST NOT include references unrelated to:
    task intent, affected_area, or dependency chain

  Exclusion reasons:
    outside_task_scope
    irrelevant_domain
    stale
    authority_conflict
    security_filter

Rules:
  [POL-01] Freshness MUST be checked for all P3+ references.
  [POL-02] Authority conflicts MUST be surfaced, not hidden.
  [POL-03] Security filter MUST run after compilation.
  [POL-04] Pollution guard MUST document exclusion reasons.

